{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/701668-pick-your-poison-favorite-foods-of-the-begotten","id":701668,"title":"Pick Your Poison - Favorite Foods of the Begotten","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-10-14T22:22:56-07:00","id":701668,"title":"Pick Your Poison - Favorite Foods of the Begotten","content":"Figured we need a thread for the &quot;specific preferences&quot; of Beast characters' Hungers, seeing as it's a significant narrative hook and its either-or applicability has a marked effect on feeding rolls.<br /> <br /> For instance, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/643809-understudy-to-the-apex-apprentice-fearmaking?p=654837#post654837\">Censer</a> has a general Hunger for Ruin, but in times of plenty the Leviathan especially craves the destruction of the written word. Blackouts and bonfires erase hours to decades of history and hard work, and the only thing the unfortunate author or curator can do is attempt to reconstruct the material from memory or write the whole thing off.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-14T22:46:49-07:00","id":701693,"title":"","content":"I once had an idea for a Collector who took works of art away from those he had decided did not fully appreciate them, though I couldn't figure out a decent Horror to represent the Hunger, nor could I decide if the concept was actually frightening.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-14T23:02:04-07:00","id":701697,"title":"","content":"A Tyrant with a taste for despair works at a suicide hotline, browbeating the callers into obeying the Namtaru's will. But any sort of desperation and sorrow based submission will work rather well. And yes, it is disgusting to take advantage people like that. Hence Namtaru for family...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-14T23:24:37-07:00","id":701729,"title":"","content":"The Ugallu I wrote, also a Ravager, likes to humble the proud. At low levels, he does so by pointing out the flaws in people's ideas; at mid, demonstrating why an idea is bad becomes necessary, whereas at high, he resorts to out and out sabotage to fuel his Hunger.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Crunch isn't a hobby; it's a calling.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1959-hexmeister-vic","name":"Hexmeister Vic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1959_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"764"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-15T14:38:40-07:00","id":702524,"title":"","content":"An Anakim Tyrant in the image of an icon: Mimir. The adviser you come to rely on so much that you can't make decisions without them. There is something so satisfying about making someone dependent on you, and then withholding your help until they submit. Over and over again.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Revlid wrote:<br /> Yes, hollowing out your humanity to become an utterly utilitarian asura is the exact suggestion I would expect from you, Aiden.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/168-aiden","name":"Aiden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1431"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-15T15:31:40-07:00","id":702554,"title":"","content":"Caretaker Novel, an Eshmaki Predator, prowles the cinemas of the world looking for his favourite prey: those that talk at the theater.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/158192-what-s-your-custom-legacy?p=1109906#post1109906\" target=\"_blank\">My custom legacy</a> (2e)- The Disciples of Rathma - Life/Death focused Moros/Thyrsus Legacy, comments appreciated","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/166-joker","name":"Joker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-15T18:52:07-07:00","id":702860,"title":"","content":"I made myself very uncomfortable when I tried, as I usually do with a new game, to make myself into a Beast. I couldn't quite do it, because I don't think I really fit, but the closest approximation was an Ugallu Raptor who likes to prey on straight guys by using You Must Obey Me, to sexually assault them to tear away their macho alpha male egos. I ... didn't realize my darkness could go in that direction and I didn't like it very much. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/avatar/20th%20Anniversary/2013~Mage%20The%20Ascension/img.php?h=120&amp;w=120&amp;img=1~M20.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1018-ophidimancer","name":"Ophidimancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1018_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"596"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-15T20:22:40-07:00","id":702955,"title":"","content":"Currently playing an Ugallu Ravager. He's a homeless-by-choice street-artist, who paints beautiful works on the sides of buildings (mostly fantasy scenes and abstract... he had a great model for his portrait of Smaug), and then burns said buildings down once they've attracted some local notice.<br /> <br /> Another concept I wound up not going with, was a Nemesis whose favorite crime to punish was animal cruelty. Never got very far with it, but that is a hot button for me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-16T06:33:46-07:00","id":703332,"title":"","content":"One of the characters I'm planing to play is a Eshmaki Tyrant who feeds on secrets, and the power that comes with it. Was considering first to make him a Collector, but I liked the idea of a Beast sitting in the shadows using the secrets of other &quot;powerfull&quot; people to make them do his bidding. Yumm <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2929-mormancar","name":"Mormancar","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-30T00:29:38-08:00","id":795446,"title":"","content":"The Ugallu Nemesis I've got percolating seems to have a thing for harrying jaywalkers; it's one of the many things being able to hit like a truck is good for.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-30T12:25:12-08:00","id":796949,"title":"","content":"Eshmaki Predator that uses his abilities to enter a protected place, leaves some kind of mark and then leaves again, leaving no sign of how he got in. Could also be a Collector if he stole stuff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-31T20:09:59-08:00","id":797625,"title":"","content":"Well this seems the most appropriate place to ask my question. So I'm working on an Eshmaki Ravager, my character is corporate spy if that helps. The problem is I haven't figured exactly what the preferences for feeding should be. Any suggestions?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-01T00:22:34-08:00","id":797701,"title":"","content":"He finds out secrets and only tells the most damaging ones to his employers, the ones that will make people howl in outrage and tear down his targets.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-01T00:51:28-08:00","id":797709,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nalak42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/701668-pick-your-poison-favorite-foods-of-the-begotten?p=797625#post797625\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well this seems the most appropriate place to ask my question. So I'm working on an Eshmaki Ravager, my character is corporate spy if that helps.</div> </div> </div> </div>Relevant questions:<br /> <br /> Is their being a corporate spy linked to their Hunger?<br /> <br /> Beyond the matters of feeding preference, what do they attempt to influence with their Legend?<br /> <br /> What's their Horror like?<br /> <br /> What's their Lair like?<br /> <br /> What Atavisms do they have at their disposal?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-01T00:53:18-08:00","id":797710,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nalak42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/701668-pick-your-poison-favorite-foods-of-the-begotten?p=797625#post797625\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well this seems the most appropriate place to ask my question. So I'm working on an Eshmaki Ravager, my character is corporate spy if that helps. The problem is I haven't figured exactly what the preferences for feeding should be. Any suggestions?</div> </div> </div> </div>Perhaps your character specializes in character assassination, such that you use your talent to cause folks to self-destruct?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Crunch isn't a hobby; it's a calling.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1959-hexmeister-vic","name":"Hexmeister Vic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1959_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"764"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-01T14:36:29-08:00","id":797982,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/701668-pick-your-poison-favorite-foods-of-the-begotten?p=797709#post797709\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Relevant questions:<br /> <br /> Is their being a corporate spy linked to their Hunger?</div> </div> </div> </div> Depends. I'm going with the character already did this sort of thing beforehand, and has figured that since the Horror just wants to see as much destruction and devastation as possible then the corporate espionage is not something that needs to go. More so considering the character had no combat ability before The Devouring and outside of the nightmares this hasn't changed.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/701668-pick-your-poison-favorite-foods-of-the-begotten?p=797709#post797709\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Beyond the matters of feeding preference, what do they attempt to influence with their Legend?</div> </div> </div> </div> Clarification request here. Are you talking like the goals of the Begotten in question, or what the Legend trait for the character is and how that tends to play out?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/701668-pick-your-poison-favorite-foods-of-the-begotten?p=797709#post797709\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What's their Horror like?</div> </div> </div> </div> I went with a mimic, so on the one hand whatever is needed to get near the prey. As far as a casual form goes I'm using the forest mimic from Exalted as a description. A cyclopean entity with the upper body of a gorilla, the horns of an ibex, and goat lower body.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/701668-pick-your-poison-favorite-foods-of-the-begotten?p=797709#post797709\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What's their Lair like?</div> </div> </div> </div> For the record I'm only at lair one right now so its small and I'm still feeling out the character,so only one chamber at the moment. The heart is an abandoned park old and in need of repair just after sundown. Weeds choking the grass vines, covering almost every structure, dried leaves litter the ground, and random sticks and branches have fallen from the trees around the place.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/701668-pick-your-poison-favorite-foods-of-the-begotten?p=797709#post797709\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What Atavisms do they have at their disposal?</div> </div> </div> </div>Mimir's Wisdom and From the Shadows.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-01T14:54:19-08:00","id":797991,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nalak42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/701668-pick-your-poison-favorite-foods-of-the-begotten?p=797982#post797982\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Clarification request here. Are you talking like the goals of the Begotten in question, or what the Legend trait for the character is and how that tends to play out?</div> </div> </div> </div>The former, though the latter would also be useful information to have.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I went with a mimic, so on the one hand whatever is needed to get near the prey. As far as a casual form goes I'm using the forest mimic from Exalted as a description. A cyclopean entity with the upper body of a gorilla, the horns of an ibex, and goat lower body.<br /> <br /> For the record I'm only at lair one right now so its small and I'm still feeling out the character,so only one chamber at the moment. The heart is an abandoned park old and in need of repair just after sundown. Weeds choking the grass vines, covering almost every structure, dried leaves litter the ground, and random sticks and branches have fallen from the trees around the place. </div> </div> </div>Depending on how far afield the job takes them, I'd advise tilting the range of their feeding activities toward sabotage.<br /> <br /> Couple more questions:<br /> <br /> What industry is their espionage concerned with?<br /> <br /> Who do they work for?<br /> <br /> Any Kinships?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-01T15:46:28-08:00","id":798004,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/701668-pick-your-poison-favorite-foods-of-the-begotten?p=797991#post797991\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The former, though the latter would also be useful information to have.</div> </div> </div> </div>I went with seductive you know take advantage of people's wants to make them get closer and careless and do that one thing that will just ruin their day.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/701668-pick-your-poison-favorite-foods-of-the-begotten?p=797991#post797991\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Couple more questions:<br /> <br /> What industry is their espionage concerned with?</div> </div> </div> </div> Originally I'm thinking some branch of the IT industry, as one of the other characters is a programmer. There may be some branching out since following The Devouring the character has not only developed an eidetic memory, but an eidetic memory that generally only exists in movies.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/701668-pick-your-poison-favorite-foods-of-the-begotten?p=797991#post797991\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Who do they work for?</div> </div> </div> </div>That I am unsure on. I would need to speak with the ST on whether or not I work for a particular company, some sort of third party group, or if I'm freelance corporate espionage.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/701668-pick-your-poison-favorite-foods-of-the-begotten?p=797991#post797991\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Any Kinships?</div> </div> </div> </div>At the moment none.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-02T23:03:39-08:00","id":799075,"title":"","content":"Oh yeah on a more direct on topic thing for the thread. One of our group's character's is named Jim. Jim is a nemesis and his Horror, salamander, has a particular fondness for punishing acts of gross horrific idiocy. Let me put it like this a low satiety hunt for him is tracking down the idiot who tags a building using their real name.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-02T23:17:05-08:00","id":799078,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nalak42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/701668-pick-your-poison-favorite-foods-of-the-begotten?p=799075#post799075\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh yeah on a more direct on topic thing for the thread. One of our group's character's is named Jim. Jim is a nemesis and his Horror, salamander, has a particular fondness for punishing acts of gross horrific idiocy. Let me put it like this a low satiety hunt for him is tracking down the idiot who tags a building using their real name.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hard to go wrong with the classics.","signature":"<hr clas